{"id":"267061f34e14c9cd","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-craig-interpolation.md","title":"Craig Theorem","display":"thm-craig-interpolation — Craig Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-craig-interpolation","aliases":["57-thm-craig-interpolation"],"display":"thm-craig-interpolation — Craig Theorem","depends_on":["[[57-df-sentence]]","[[57-df-logical-consequence]]","[[57-df-formula]]","[[57-df-term]]","[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-craig-interpolation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-craig-interpolation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-craig-interpolation — Craig Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"38cb16fd577caf7b\" href=\"?note=38cb16fd577caf7b\" title=\"57-df-sentence\">57-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d75d3bc1b6b86e1f\" href=\"?note=d75d3bc1b6b86e1f\" title=\"57-df-logical-consequence\">57-df-logical-consequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"76e02a8ebe51f748\" href=\"?note=76e02a8ebe51f748\" title=\"57-df-formula\">57-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"053d3ef4d2401abe\" href=\"?note=053d3ef4d2401abe\" title=\"57-df-term\">57-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为一阶字母表，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span>，假定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\">\\(\\models(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sym}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sym}\\)</span> 是下式按项与公式有限树递归给出的非逻辑符号集合函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_S\">\\(c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_n(S)\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_n(S)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S)\">\\(R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\">\\(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\">\\(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sym}(x)\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad\\mathrm{Sym}(c)\\coloneqq\\{c\\},\\quad\\mathrm{Sym}(f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n))\\coloneqq\\{f\\}\\cup\\bigcup_{i=1}^n\\mathrm{Sym}(t_i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sym}(x)\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad\\mathrm{Sym}(c)\\coloneqq\\{c\\},\\quad\\mathrm{Sym}(f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n))\\coloneqq\\{f\\}\\cup\\bigcup_{i=1}^n\\mathrm{Sym}(t_i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sym}(s\\doteq t)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sym}(s)\\cup\\mathrm{Sym}(t),\\quad\\mathrm{Sym}(R(t_1,\\ldots,t_n))\\coloneqq\\{R\\}\\cup\\bigcup_{i=1}^n\\mathrm{Sym}(t_i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sym}(s\\doteq t)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sym}(s)\\cup\\mathrm{Sym}(t),\\quad\\mathrm{Sym}(R(t_1,\\ldots,t_n))\\coloneqq\\{R\\}\\cup\\bigcup_{i=1}^n\\mathrm{Sym}(t_i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sym}(\\neg\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sym}(\\alpha),\\quad\\mathrm{Sym}(\\alpha\\circ\\beta)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sym}(\\alpha)\\cup\\mathrm{Sym}(\\beta),\\quad\\mathrm{Sym}(Qx\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sym}(\\alpha).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sym}(\\neg\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sym}(\\alpha),\\quad\\mathrm{Sym}(\\alpha\\circ\\beta)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sym}(\\alpha)\\cup\\mathrm{Sym}(\\beta),\\quad\\mathrm{Sym}(Qx\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sym}(\\alpha).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;[\\models(\\varphi\\to\\theta)\\land\\models(\\theta\\to\\psi)\\land\\mathrm{Sym}(\\theta)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sym}(\\varphi)\\cap\\mathrm{Sym}(\\psi)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;[\\models(\\varphi\\to\\theta)\\land\\models(\\theta\\to\\psi)\\land\\mathrm{Sym}(\\theta)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sym}(\\varphi)\\cap\\mathrm{Sym}(\\psi)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure>","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"38cb16fd577caf7b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-logical-consequence","status":"resolved","id":"d75d3bc1b6b86e1f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-logical-consequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-formula","